    "description": "The building is a single room based on the BESTEST Case 900 model definition. The floor dimensions are 6m x 8m and the floor-to-ceiling height is 2.7m. There are four exterior walls facing the cardinal directions and a flat roof. The walls facing east-west have the short dimension. The south wall contains two windows, each 3m wide and 2m tall. The use of the building is assumed to be a two-person office with a light load density.",
    "zone_point_names": {
